        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="GTA 6" class="game-img" onerror="this.src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?q=80&w=600'">

